  },
  {
   "say": "Turkey: about one hundred ten thousand Greek Orthodox in 1923. Fewer than two thousand five hundred today."
  },
  {
   "say": "Bethlehem, where Christmas began: about six thousand Christians for decades. Now, roughly half that."
  },
  {
   "say": "And Israel?"
  },
  {
   "say": "Thirty six thousand Christians in 1950. One hundred eighty four thousand today. Up every single decade."
  },
  {
   "say": "Of these five charts, only one line is green.",
